3. Architecture
3.1 Goals & Constraints
Goals: secure, reliable and modular platform for Attendee, Organizer and Admin roles; 90th-percentile response
time ≤3 seconds under up to 500 concurrent users; 99.5% monthly uptime excluding scheduled maintenance.
Constraints: TLS 1.2+ for all network traffic; bcrypt password hashing; PCI-DSS compliant payment gateway with
no raw card data stored by EMS; WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility; specified technology stack (React.js,
Node.js/Express, MongoDB); a minimum 2-year retention of event and transaction logs for audit and dispute
resolution.
