3.5 Chosen Architecture Pattern and Rationale
Layered (n-tier) architecture is chosen for clear separation of concerns between UI, business logic and data. This
matches the React/Node/Express/MongoDB stack stated in the SRS, simplifies testing, and supports horizontal
scaling of booking and notification services. Microservices were considered but rejected as overly complex for
the current project scope and team size.
