4.4 Error Handling, Logging & Monitoring
• Use consistent HTTP status codes and standardized, safe error messages.
• No sensitive info (passwords, card data) in logs.
• Audit security and moderation actions.
• Monitor booking failure rate, payment success rate, notification delivery, and API uptime.
4.5 UX Design
EMS UI is responsive for mobile, tablet and desktop, with accessible fonts, high-contrast mode, and screenreader support conforming to WCAG 2.1 AA. Main navigation covers event discovery, booking, ticket/QR display,
and role-specific dashboards for Organizers and Admins.
